          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Pesahia mwene Meshezabeeli, ow'omuri beene Zeera, mwene Yuda, akaba ari omuntu w'omugabe owaabaire amuhwera omuri byona ebirikufa aha bantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.24",
