              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi aha birikukwata aha birorero n'emisiri yaabyo, abamwe aha Bayuda bakaba batwire Kiryasi-araba n'omu birorero byayo, Diboni n'omu birorero byayo, Yekabuzeeli n'omu birorero byayo, ",
          "type": "text",
